Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices We take in the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah Here we are in between the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and the sky Ready now for adventure We're\Nitching to try Get ready to roam So all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,aboard now we're said to go Set sail to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the ocean so deep Ready for a truly grand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure Well don't you think that sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,really fun All this\Nexcitement second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull it together. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something I think all those shadows\Nwe gave him were too much after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even someone as powerful as\Nhim still isn't invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He absorbed the strength\Nof a hundred shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He pushed his body to the absolute limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we want all this to be for nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we gotta get those shadows back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. We gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look to the east and\Nsee how bad it is yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will be up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we have to do\Nto get the shadows back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He took four of them from our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a plan, but there's a little snag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat was the one who was\Ngonna make Moria give them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he can move in his condition,\Nmuch less make anybody do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria took the shadows and\Nplaced them into zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Lord of the Shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,he and he alone must order them\Nto return to their former masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, they'll stay\Nright where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Less talk, more action! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta force Maurya to give the\Norder to release them no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't get the Shadows\Nback, beating it was pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Horses back on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible how the Hennessy ate\Nhim to move after beating you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the Straw Hats\Nare down for the count!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They were our last hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We already used them against\Nthem and it wasn't enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the best shot we had!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the Straw Hats could\Nfight, he's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're completely out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We never stood a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be stuck living in\Nthis darkness forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's head back to the\Nforest where the sun never shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the night forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how it was for Luffy,\Nbut oars took one hell of a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to die, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After oars pounded him\Nmercilessly, he can still stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he some kind of zombie too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the bodies\Nof the Straw Hat crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They were right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They were here just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't move around on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That long-nosed guy and\Nthe woman just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't have gotten up and\Nrun away on their own, could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they all\Ndisappear at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we can't worry about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to give him just one\Nmore punch. Straw Hat? You two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't move, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's too worn out\Nto get up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get up there! I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll provide some footholds for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I, too, am still willing and able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A living, breathing, talking\Nskeleton with an apro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's back up and\Nready for the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did she get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you mean these guys didn't\Neven think about running
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,away from the second the\Ndoor stood back up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all just getting\Nready for the next round!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper we gotta hurry\Nthe sun's coming up Right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can still use\Nthis thing? It's fine. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it And\Nto think we were all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,about to throw in the towel Hey it's about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to get real ugly here\Nso get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay gotcha we'll leave\Nit to you then Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,pierre la fleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Some smoke? Clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The forecast calls for rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain tip-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that rain come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see some kind of\Nwizard or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, emergency plumbing\Nconstruction complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, coo tip-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it all you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to freeze a giant, nothing\Nmeans a super-sized Sub-Zero wing cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They've frozen with the rainwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid change! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that thing off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Good shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now toss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's made of rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom! Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thousand worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn again! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good one, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We got his back nice and straight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell are these guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The structure's the same as a human's,\Nwhich means the spine is S-shaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,designed to carry weight as well\Nas soften impact to the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But when the spine is\Npulled into a straight line,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't be able to absorb impact,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll have to bear the\Nfull force of Luffy's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready for a special bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just knock you back\Nwith my own special bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kum Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My arm's being all crappy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His inability to feel any pain\Nturned out to be a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish him off\Nand take back your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kum Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Take it, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it down, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could get back up\Nafter something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:11:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He really lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he was so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to Thriller Bark?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat crew is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like I invited nothing\Nbut trouble to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to our master?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anybody see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They really did it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They really were our\Nshining stars of hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Straw Hat is our savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you get so tiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt, but I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with his bones crushed, he can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,These zombies really do\Nmake a mockery of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This strange sensation\Ncoursing through my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up with those shadows,\Nthe sun is coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you cheering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you get your shadows back,\Nyou're all going to burn to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right! I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go wake Mordial with the beating\Nand make him release the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning's almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Master's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I wasn't\Nworried about him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, that just saves us the\Ntrouble of waking you ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,unless you want another serious beating\Nfrom the Straw Hats, you'll do what we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Return all the shadows now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, give them back, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think this\Nis, a playground brawl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A true pirate would never\Nbow to demands like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,not even if his life depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Saw you teamed up with those\Nlosers from the forest, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke Now I see how Straw Hat\Ngot that ridiculous increase in power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How desperate you must be to use\Nmy own shadow abilities against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:14:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the shadows at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, you've got some\Nnerve making a mess of Thriller Bark!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you've\Ndone to my glorious ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for picking\Na fight with my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get back those shadows\Nbefore the sun comes up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, when at this point all I have to do\Nis sit around and wait for you all to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're not cut\Nout for the new world, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit you've got some good\Nunderlings, but it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, this isn't exactly the\Ntime to sit around and chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting brighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on getting the shadows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because unlike me, you've yet to\Nrealize the weakness of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They were mortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what makes things\Ndifferent this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Had they been zombies from the beginning,\NI would have had nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zomnius are fearless,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,eternal, relentless warriors that can\Nbe replaced even if they fall! Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,with my army of the undead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing in the world that will\Nstop me from becoming king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your crew should be grateful\Nfor the chance to serve as my slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss! It's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, every last shot of Ibrillabark,\Ncome to me and become my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,SHADOWS! ASCARD!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His shadow came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.02,0:17:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gathering up every shadow on this\Nisland and pumping them into his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,from your strength I'd say you\Nabsorbed about a hundred shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall take one\Nhundred, two hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,three hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,four hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,five hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:17:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even hide from that thing. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat needed a\Nhundred shadows to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even with devil\Nfruit powers on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, we're all doomed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of even trying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll beat us no matter what we do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got Straw Hats shadow inside him too
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wrecking his own ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Run to the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My skin's melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.90,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is run and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Lola!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can run if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will kill you too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take some\Nresponsibility. This battle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my fight too look at them do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not budging.\NThey're completely fearless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in the same\Nboat we are they've lost
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,their shadows too come on you don't\Nthink they? can still win. Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're goners if the sun hits them,\Nand look at Merde, he's indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even stronger than Orbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If they won't give up on this fight,\Nthen I'm with them all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought our battle\Nmight end up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was willing to place my bets\Non the Straw Hats all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't regret making\Nthat decision one single bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could defeat that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job to see this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And as your leader, I want you to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Lola! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the sunlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get in the shadows, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine where I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to\Nput your faith in someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't falter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.28,0:20:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept whatever fate\Nhas in store for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Live or die, that's my final decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.38,0:21:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never leaving the light again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is the big boss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think\Nthey get much bigger He
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,let his pride and anger\Nget the best of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's losing control of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys,\Nwe're almost out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to go wild here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you to take care of\Nthe rest You got it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your damn minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster with the\Nstrength of a thousand people!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Think for a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got your shadows\Ntrapped in there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means he's got your powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you've\Nonly got a few minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth if you're\Nnot gonna help us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:22:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle's already over,\Nand Moria knows he's lost. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.72,0:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our real enemy here is the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a\Nfight against the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria sucking in all\Nthose shadows was just
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.06,0:22:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a desperate move to try and buy some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Either the sun wipes us out or\NMoria destroys himself. Go, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows are escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like hundreds of\Nshadows are pouring out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.96,0:23:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the shadows\Nwere under his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Merde is losing consciousness, so he's\Nlosing control of the shadows he stole, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even he's powerful enough for his\Nmind to handle that many shadows at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum! No! Break that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I call that one the black box!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he trapped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.28,0:23:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,From the fist that cracked the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.00,0:23:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this your punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know what happens\Nto cocky little snorts
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that think they can sail\Ninto my neck of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.06,0:24:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fate of all those who\Nstand in the way of the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta know your\Nplace in the world, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nails that stick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're only asking to\Nget hammered back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.52,0:24:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.42,0:24:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A nail that sticks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.98,0:24:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammer me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.40,0:25:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You really believe that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost impressive\Nhow damn arrogant you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,kid What the hell makes you\Nthink you're so indestructible?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As rubber bounces back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.64,0:25:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you spit\Nout all those shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.82,0:25:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He might do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jinx it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.26,0:25:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura, get back in the shade or\Nyou're going to disintegrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.46,0:25:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.37,0:25:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire! Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of places to hide here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna bump it up to third gear what\Nis he out of his mind you've got to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Movie you're going way too far don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,remember what happened the\Nlast time you use that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.84,0:26:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.12,0:26:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.50,0:26:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.88,0:26:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's leaking shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.26,0:26:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your master and you will obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.74,0:26:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get back in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.82,0:26:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.46,0:26:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fighting them all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.88,0:26:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.30,0:26:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, my shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.98,0:27:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.02,0:27:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.94,0:27:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now return to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been together ever since birth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We were born as one!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.50,0:27:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't belong to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.34,0:27:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We belong together!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please return to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've spent three long years searching\Nfor the zombie you were trapped inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.86,0:27:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hear my voice, please return!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.80,0:27:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gabiola!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.68,0:27:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let you stand out\Nhere and destroy yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in the shade before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.34,0:27:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't tell me\Nyou guys can't feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.66,0:27:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got our shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of them is\Ninside Morty's stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.86,0:27:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a hundred feet from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we run, we might\Nnever get another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.74,0:27:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, we can't take on a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to try. Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.36,0:28:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Return home, shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some words for my shadow, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.62,0:28:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to be the shadow\Nof the King of the Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.18,0:28:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...then you better shape up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And come back, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.94,0:29:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.18,0:29:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.68,0:29:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you had it tough so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.18,0:29:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, the real nightmare's\Nwaiting for you in the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.60,0:29:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're actually coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, get down, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.50,0:30:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.62,0:30:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Little baby!
